@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Create order (cart resolved from current user — hardcoded for now)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "couponCode": "SAVE10",
  "loyaltyPointsAmount": 100
}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:3000/orders

### Get order by id
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/{{orderId}}

### Update order
PATCH http://localhost:3000/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### Delete order
DELETE http://localhost:3000/orders/{{orderId}}
